# Copy to ~/.config/sketchybar/checks (per machine, never committed) and reload
# SketchyBar. One check per line: `name | command`. Green when the command exits
# 0 within 10 s. The bar shows passed/total; click it for each check.
#
# `kube <context>` checks that the context's token/credentials are still valid.
rancher | kube rancher-prod
eks     | kube eks-dev
# Any shell command works too:
vpn     | nc -z -G 2 10.0.0.1 443
